note The same walk keyed by call line, with the hierarchical numbers attached: (step, depth, 1.2.3) in reading order. The CLI document, the GUI steps list, document, breadcrumb and graph nodes all number steps through this one function, so a step carries the same number wherever it is shown. A child with no symbol, or whose symbol no line of the parent's slice calls, sorts after its siblings that have a call line.

